                    <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">1+</p>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Years Teaching</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm p-5">
