    <!-- ═══════════ ABOUT ═══════════ -->
    <section id="about" class="py-24 bg-white reveal">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
            <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
                <p class="text-blue-600 font-semibold text-sm tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">About Me</p>
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-tight">
                    Building technology that <span class="accent-gradient">supports people</span>.
                </h2>
            </div>

            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                    <p>
                        I'm a Software Engineering student currently pursuing a <strong class="text-slate-900">Diploma in Software Development at ICS College</strong> and a <strong class="text-slate-900">Diploma in Software Engineering at MOHI Technical Training Institute</strong>. I serve as a Cisco Networking Academy Instructor, where I teach networking fundamentals, computer systems, cybersecurity awareness, and effective technology use.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        My journey began in 2024 with an <strong class="text-slate-900">Advanced IT certificate at MOHI Technical Training, Pangani</strong> — the program that first introduced me to programming and sparked my career in technology. Since then, I've earned multiple Cisco certifications, built web applications, and supported dozens of learners and staff in ICT environments.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        I have a strong problem-solving, communication, and customer-service orientation, with a proactive approach to technical support. I document everything, I escalate when needed, and I never leave a user stuck.
                    </p>

                    <div class="pt-6">
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">What I focus on</h3>
                        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1"></i>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">First-line ICT support & troubleshooting</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1"></i>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">Cisco routing, switching & LAN support</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1"></i>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">Windows & Linux system administration</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1"></i>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">Web development & database design</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1"></i>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">User training & technical documentation</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1"></i>
                                <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">Basic information security practices</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-6">
                        <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt text-blue-600 text-xl mb-3"></i>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Location</p>
                        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Nairobi, Kenya</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-6">
                        <i class="fas fa-briefcase text-blue-600 text-xl mb-3"></i>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Currently</p>
                        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Cisco Instructor @ MOHI Namarei</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-6">
                        <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap text-blue-600 text-xl mb-3"></i>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Studying</p>
                        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">ICS College • MOHI TTI</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ SKILLS ═══════════ -->
    <section id="skills" class="py-24 bg-slate-50 reveal">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
            <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
                <p class="text-blue-600 font-semibold text-sm tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">Skills</p>
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-tight">
                    Tools & technologies I <span class="accent-gradient">work with</span>.
                </h2>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <div class="card bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-8">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
                        <i class="fas fa-headset text-blue-600 text-2xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">ICT Support</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-5">End-user support, hardware & software troubleshooting, ICT asset documentation, and user training.</p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <span class="text-xs bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Help Desk</span>
                        <span class="text-xs bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Windows</span>
                        <span class="text-xs bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Linux</span>
                        <span class="text-xs bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Kali</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 p-8">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
                        <i class="fas fa-network-wired text-green-600 text-2xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Networking</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-5">LAN/WAN connectivity, Cisco router & switch configuration, cabling, and network troubleshooting.</p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Cisco</span>
                        <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">TCP/IP</span>
                        <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Packet Tracer</span>
                        <span class="text-xs bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Routing</span>
